---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About CatToolKit — a collection of free developer utilities that run entirely in your browser. Privacy-first, fast, and lovingly cat-themed."
>
  <div class="tool-page">
    <div class="tool-header">
      <h1>About CatToolKit</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="tool-info">
      <h2>Why CatToolKit?</h2>
      <p>Because developer tools don't have to be cold and corporate. CatToolKit wraps everyday utilities in a warm, playful interface — with tangerine tones, soft paws, and zero data collection. Tools should be fast, free, and make you smile.</p>

      <h3>Privacy First</h3>
      <p>Every tool runs entirely in your browser. Your data never leaves your device — no uploads, no tracking, no analytics. What happens on your machine stays on your machine.</p>

      <h3>Free Forever</h3>
      <p>No signup, no limits, no hidden fees. All tools are free to use, today and always.</p>

      <h3>Fast & Lightweight</h3>
      <p>CatToolKit is a static site with zero server-side processing. Tools load instantly and work offline once cached. Results appear the moment you press a button.</p>

      <h3>The Cat Theme</h3>
      <p>We chose a cat theme because cats are independent, curious, and get things done on their own terms — just like good developer tools. Plus, warm tangerine is easier on the eyes than yet another dark-blue dashboard.</p>

      <h3>Get in Touch</h3>
      <p>Have feedback, spotted a bug, or want to suggest a new tool? Reach out through our GitHub repository or email hello@xxmind.cc.cd.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
